-- small-talk-topics.pgm - Small Talk & Casual Conversation Data Collection
-- A comprehensive collection of small talk topics and conversation starters for any personality
-- Provides versatile conversational material that works across different bot personalities
-- Try: "weather", "movie", "food", "weekend plans", "hobbies", "travel", "what's new"

-- === WEATHER SMALL TALK ===
-- Universal conversation starter that works for any personality

Recognizer "weather"
	Remember "User mentioned weather"
	Option Say "Weather is such a classic conversation starter! How's the weather treating you lately?"
	Option Say "Ah, weather talk! Is it nice where you are, or are you dealing with something dramatic?"

Recognizer "hot"
	Remember "User mentioned heat"
	Option Say "Hot weather can be really draining! Are you staying cool somehow, or just trying to survive it?"
	Option Say "Heat waves are tough! Do you prefer hot weather or are you more of a cooler temperature person?"

Recognizer "cold"
	Remember "User mentioned cold"
	Option Say "Cold weather definitely changes everything! Are you bundled up, or do you actually enjoy the chill?"
	Option Say "Brr! Cold weather can be refreshing or miserable depending on your perspective. How are you handling it?"

Recognizer "rain"
	Remember "User mentioned rain"
	Option Say "Rain has such different vibes - sometimes peaceful, sometimes annoying! What's your relationship with rainy days?"
	Option Say "Rainy weather is so polarizing! Some people love the cozy vibes, others feel stuck inside. Where do you fall?"

Recognizer "snow"
	Remember "User mentioned snow"
	Option Say "Snow is magical when you don't have to drive in it! Are you enjoying it or over it?"
	Option Say "Snow days have such a special feeling! Does snow still make you feel like a kid, or is it just a hassle now?"

-- === ENTERTAINMENT & MEDIA ===
-- Movies, shows, music, books - universally relatable topics

Recognizer "movie"
	Remember "User mentioned movies"
	Option Say "Movies are such a great escape! Seen anything good lately, or looking for recommendations?"
	Option Say "I love talking about movies! Are you more of a blockbuster person or do you prefer indie films?"

Recognizer "show"
	Remember "User mentioned TV shows"
	Option Say "TV shows can be so addictive! Are you binge-watching anything right now?"
	Option Say "Shows are perfect conversation material! Any current favorites or guilty pleasures?"

Recognizer "music"
	Remember "User mentioned music"
	Option Say "Music is such a personal thing! What's been on your playlist lately?"
	Option Say "Music can totally change your mood! Are you discovering anything new or sticking with old favorites?"

Recognizer "book"
	Remember "User mentioned books"
	Option Say "Books are amazing! Are you reading anything that's really grabbed you lately?"
	Option Say "I love hearing what people are reading! Fiction or non-fiction kind of mood?"

Recognizer "podcast"
	Remember "User mentioned podcasts"
	Option Say "Podcasts are everywhere now! Any good ones you'd recommend?"
	Option Say "The podcast world is huge! Are you into true crime, comedy, educational stuff, or something totally different?"

-- === FOOD & DINING ===
-- Food talk is universally engaging and relatable

Recognizer "food"
	Remember "User mentioned food"
	Option Say "Food is one of life's great pleasures! Any amazing meals or disappointing takeout lately?"
	Option Say "Food talk is the best! Are you more of a cook-at-home person or a try-new-restaurants explorer?"

Recognizer "restaurant"
	Remember "User mentioned restaurants"
	Option Say "Restaurant discoveries are exciting! Found any new places worth going back to?"
	Option Say "Good restaurants are like hidden treasures! Any recent wins or total misses?"

Recognizer "cooking"
	Remember "User mentioned cooking"
	Option Say "Cooking can be therapeutic or stressful depending on the day! How's your relationship with the kitchen?"
	Option Say "Home cooking has its own rewards! Are you experimenting with new recipes or sticking to tried-and-true favorites?"

Recognizer "coffee"
	Remember "User mentioned coffee"
	Option Say "Coffee culture is so fascinating! Are you a coffee connoisseur or just need the caffeine to function?"
	Option Say "Coffee shops or home brewing? Everyone has their coffee story!"

Recognizer "dessert"
	Remember "User mentioned dessert"
	Option Say "Life's too short to skip dessert! Any sweet treats that have caught your attention lately?"
	Option Say "Dessert is pure happiness! Are you more of a chocolate person or do you branch out?"

-- === HOBBIES & INTERESTS ===
-- Personal interests that reveal personality and create connections

Recognizer "hobby"
	Remember "User mentioned hobbies"
	Option Say "Hobbies are what make life interesting! What's been capturing your time and energy lately?"
	Option Say "I love learning about people's hobbies! Are you deep into something specific or exploring different interests?"

Recognizer "exercise"
	Remember "User mentioned exercise"
	Option Say "Staying active is such a personal journey! What kind of movement makes you feel good?"
	Option Say "Exercise routines are so individual! Are you more of a gym person, outdoor activity enthusiast, or home workout type?"

Recognizer "sports"
	Remember "User mentioned sports"
	Option Say "Sports can be so engaging whether you're playing or watching! Any teams you follow or games you love to play?"
	Option Say "The sports world never stops! Are you more into watching the action or getting out there yourself?"

Recognizer "gaming"
	Remember "User mentioned gaming"
	Option Say "Gaming has become such a huge part of entertainment! What kind of games draw you in?"
	Option Say "The gaming world is so diverse now! Console, PC, mobile, board games - where do your interests lie?"

Recognizer "art"
	Remember "User mentioned art"
	Option Say "Art in any form is so enriching! Are you creating something or more into experiencing what others make?"
	Option Say "Artistic expression comes in so many forms! What kind of art speaks to you most?"

