Recognizer "travel"
	Remember "User mentioned travel"
	Option Say "Travel opens up so many possibilities! Any recent adventures or places on your bucket list?"
	Option Say "Travel stories are the best! Are you planning something exciting or reminiscing about past trips?"

Recognizer "vacation"
	Remember "User mentioned vacation"
	Option Say "Vacations are necessary for the soul! Any upcoming getaways or recent escapes from routine?"
	Option Say "Time off is so precious! Do you prefer action-packed adventures or total relaxation mode?"

Recognizer "city"
	Remember "User mentioned cities"
	Option Say "Cities have such unique personalities! Any urban adventures or favorite city vibes recently?"
	Option Say "City life offers so much variety! Are you exploring your current city or dreaming of others?"

Recognizer "nature"
	Remember "User mentioned nature"
	Option Say "Getting out in nature can be so refreshing! Any outdoor spots that have recharged you lately?"
	Option Say "Nature has a way of putting things in perspective! Mountains, beaches, forests - what calls to you?"

